WEBVTT

00:28.069 --> 00:31.823
Because helping others
eventually ends up being good for me.

00:45.128 --> 00:46.212
Run.

00:47.464 --> 00:48.548
You.

00:54.095 --> 00:56.931
You'll just get in my way,
so get out of here, will you?

01:41.476 --> 01:44.479
Demon Slayer: Swordsmith Village Arc

02:58.344 --> 03:02.974
Episode 4: Thank You, Tokito

03:18.323 --> 03:22.785
Even if I cut what appears to be the neck,
it's not disintegrating, but regenerating.

03:23.870 --> 03:25.246
Then, it must be that type.

03:44.182 --> 03:46.309
It was getting power from the vase.

03:46.809 --> 03:49.687
Just as I thought. It was created
by some Blood Demon Art.

03:56.069 --> 03:58.529
Thank you!

03:58.613 --> 04:01.824
I thought I was gonna die! Really die!

04:01.908 --> 04:03.326
I was so scared!

04:05.286 --> 04:07.872
I was wrong to call you kelp head!

04:07.956 --> 04:09.832
I'm sorry!

04:10.667 --> 04:12.835
Kelp head? You mean me?

04:16.506 --> 04:19.467
I'm sorry! I hated you!

04:20.426 --> 04:22.470
I don't have time for this.

04:22.971 --> 04:25.556
I'm going,
so you can do whatever you want.

04:28.851 --> 04:29.852
Wait.

04:30.436 --> 04:32.146
Kanamori is being attacked.

04:32.230 --> 04:34.899
I was also attacked
when I came out to get help.

04:39.821 --> 04:43.783
Haganezuka is working day and night
to polish and restore a sword.

04:43.866 --> 04:47.036
If his work stops even a little bit,
it won't be good anymore.

04:47.120 --> 04:50.248
Please, help us.

04:55.503 --> 04:56.838
I beg you.

04:59.674 --> 05:02.010
Well, I…

05:05.722 --> 05:11.019
You will definitely regain yourself,
Muichiro.

05:16.733 --> 05:18.484
I know, you must be confused.

05:19.277 --> 05:22.363
But for now, just think about surviving.

05:23.906 --> 05:26.784
As long as you are alive,
it will work out somehow.

05:29.746 --> 05:32.332
Your lost memories will return.

05:33.291 --> 05:34.459
No need to worry.

05:37.837 --> 05:40.006
Don't ignore this opportunity.

05:42.925 --> 05:45.553
Trivial things will spark something.

05:47.305 --> 05:52.560
And then,
it will clear the fog inside your head.

06:02.445 --> 06:03.696
Slow down a little!

06:03.780 --> 06:06.532
Don't go so fast!

06:06.616 --> 06:08.493
You'll bite your tongue if you talk.

06:11.746 --> 06:13.539
Is this the right decision?

06:14.373 --> 06:17.585
By doing this, I won't be able
to protect the entire village.

06:19.128 --> 06:20.129
No, I can do this.

06:21.130 --> 06:23.800
I'm a member of the Corps
recognized by the Master,

06:24.675 --> 06:28.137
Muichiro Tokito, the Mist Hashira.

06:45.613 --> 06:46.614
Crap!

06:47.115 --> 06:49.534
I cut it. What should I do?

06:50.243 --> 06:51.619
It will multiply.

06:52.120 --> 06:55.248
JOY

06:58.209 --> 06:59.085
FOUR - UPPER
JOY

06:59.168 --> 07:00.461
Both have the same name?

07:09.887 --> 07:12.932
I see. I get it now.

07:15.268 --> 07:17.687
The attacks are less powerful.

07:18.354 --> 07:21.524
They probably won't get
infinitely stronger with every split.

07:22.275 --> 07:23.109
ANGER

07:23.192 --> 07:24.861
I saw letters in their mouths.

07:25.528 --> 07:26.779
It's four human emotions.

07:27.280 --> 07:30.116
It's likely those four are the strongest.

07:30.199 --> 07:31.325
JOY

07:31.409 --> 07:33.161
And if they split any further,

07:34.036 --> 07:35.163
they're less powerful.

07:44.213 --> 07:45.214
Behind me.

07:52.638 --> 07:53.639
I have to defeat

07:54.140 --> 07:55.349
at least one of them.

07:55.850 --> 07:57.602
And get back to Nezuko and Genya.

08:00.271 --> 08:02.773
The demon mouth I stabbed disappeared?

08:04.275 --> 08:06.652
I knew it. The split won't go any further.

08:13.326 --> 08:14.785
How do you like my claws?

08:15.453 --> 08:20.500
With this speed and sharpness,
they can even crush a diamond!

08:24.504 --> 08:26.088
You should be trembling.

08:27.590 --> 08:31.802
Let me enjoy your blood splashing.

08:44.941 --> 08:45.942
You too.

09:18.474 --> 09:20.351
How dare you!

09:31.821 --> 09:34.615
I want to get back
to Nezuko and Genya quickly.

09:35.116 --> 09:36.117
But how?

09:36.867 --> 09:38.911
Nezuko, hang in there!

09:58.848 --> 10:01.309
Hang in there a little longer, girl.

10:04.562 --> 10:06.063
Hey. What's wrong?

10:06.147 --> 10:08.983
Rip her limbs off right away.

10:09.066 --> 10:11.402
You're just getting me angry.

10:11.485 --> 10:15.406
Don't interfere. This girl is mine.

10:15.489 --> 10:17.867
You and Aizetsu go somewhere else.

10:18.451 --> 10:22.788
Karaku, let me finish her off.

10:25.750 --> 10:27.251
I can't pull out my spear.

10:31.130 --> 10:34.175
Your opponent is me.

10:37.720 --> 10:40.222
How can you get shot, Aizetsu?

10:40.723 --> 10:42.141
How infuriating.

10:42.224 --> 10:43.267
You fool.

10:46.395 --> 10:49.190
Shit! It's getting pulled out.

11:00.660 --> 11:04.330
It's too sad that you won't die instantly.

11:17.093 --> 11:21.931
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

11:40.116 --> 11:43.285
I aimed for a vital spot
so he could die quickly.

11:43.369 --> 11:47.289
It didn't work
because he held on to my spear.

11:51.377 --> 11:54.004
But now he will surely die.

12:04.765 --> 12:07.726
What? Is he chanting the Amida Sutra?

12:08.310 --> 12:11.147
How devout is he.

12:11.730 --> 12:13.691
Isn't he still alive?

12:13.774 --> 12:15.734
Crush his head, Aizetsu!

12:16.527 --> 12:19.447
I know, so stop yelling, will you?

12:19.947 --> 12:21.449
It makes me sad.

12:25.870 --> 12:30.499
I'll cut your neck as many times
as it takes to kill you worms!

12:34.128 --> 12:38.257
Shit! There's no way
to dodge this lightning.

12:38.340 --> 12:41.093
That Khakkhara-wielding bastard!

12:46.182 --> 12:47.725
What the hell is this guy?

12:47.808 --> 12:52.188
Why won't he die even though Aizetsu
has inflicted a fatal blow?

13:00.237 --> 13:03.782
Hey! That guy looks more fun
to be playing with.

13:05.409 --> 13:07.995
I'm done with you, girl.

13:14.376 --> 13:15.377
Sekido.

13:15.878 --> 13:20.132
After I rip off this demon girl's limbs,
stab her with your Khakkhara.

13:20.216 --> 13:23.260
Then stun her with lightning
so she won't move.

13:24.220 --> 13:26.722
That was my intention from the start.

13:35.648 --> 13:38.067
The heck is with her kicking power?

13:51.747 --> 13:53.832
What are you doing, you fool?

14:31.078 --> 14:32.997
So fast. His speed has increased.

14:34.415 --> 14:36.250
Although I want to get back quickly,

14:36.333 --> 14:38.919
and the building where they are
is right over there…

14:39.503 --> 14:41.005
What should I do? Think!

14:42.965 --> 14:43.799
Right.

14:44.300 --> 14:46.427
If I can't defeat him here and now--

14:47.011 --> 14:50.347
But wait,
the situation might get even worse.

14:51.015 --> 14:52.808
I don't know. I have no idea.

14:54.518 --> 14:57.438
Don't hesitate.
I just have to do it anyway.

15:04.486 --> 15:05.863
Nezuko, Genya,

15:07.031 --> 15:09.575
don't die on me. I'll be there soon.

15:17.041 --> 15:19.084
I guess he's dead already.

15:32.014 --> 15:33.849
How are you still alive?

15:34.600 --> 15:35.517
What…

15:36.101 --> 15:38.938
What the hell are you?

15:43.442 --> 15:45.152
You wanna know?

15:47.154 --> 15:50.366
My name is Genya Shinazugawa.

15:51.158 --> 15:53.202
Make sure you remember it.

16:00.459 --> 16:02.628
It's the name of the man…

16:10.761 --> 16:12.888
…who's gonna kill you!

16:14.848 --> 16:17.267
Nezuko and Genya are
in the building right there.

16:18.394 --> 16:20.437
I need to get there quickly.

16:22.147 --> 16:23.691
Don't misjudge the direction.

16:24.733 --> 16:27.403
I'll take advantage
of his flight and momentum

16:28.362 --> 16:31.865
to save Nezuko and Genya
as soon as possible.

16:40.124 --> 16:41.458
Why are you running?

16:41.542 --> 16:43.585
Where is your earlier smugness?

17:02.021 --> 17:03.564
Just as I thought, he's light.

17:04.982 --> 17:08.819
Otherwise, he wouldn't be able
to fly around with wings that size.

17:10.070 --> 17:10.904
I can do this!

17:34.344 --> 17:35.846
Nezuko! Genya!

17:37.931 --> 17:40.267
Not only Karaku, but Urogi too.

17:40.768 --> 17:42.227
What are they doing?

17:45.731 --> 17:46.857
Nezuko!

17:46.940 --> 17:48.859
Stop it!

17:51.236 --> 17:54.281
So infuriating. You all make me angry.

17:58.702 --> 17:59.745
Urogi's foot?

18:00.954 --> 18:04.917
Since it has the same cells as mine,
the lightning won't pass through it.

18:05.959 --> 18:08.087
This boy has good instincts.

18:09.755 --> 18:13.050
When he broke into this room,

18:13.133 --> 18:15.886
he cut Urogi's foot in an instant.

18:18.305 --> 18:20.015
He's a quick thinker in a fight.

18:21.433 --> 18:23.393
I can't cut him with just one hand.

18:23.977 --> 18:25.729
Tongue. Aim for his tongue.

18:32.152 --> 18:33.654
If their tongues are damaged,

18:34.238 --> 18:37.699
these demons will regenerate more slowly.

18:39.576 --> 18:41.120
Good. I can pull this out.

18:42.830 --> 18:44.748
ANGER

18:46.375 --> 18:48.001
You'll pay for this.

18:49.711 --> 18:51.713
Crap. He's already recovered.

18:56.260 --> 18:57.386
It stopped?

19:02.558 --> 19:03.392
Nezuko.

19:07.479 --> 19:09.439
What an insolent Demon Art.

19:10.023 --> 19:12.860
Incredible.
Nezuko's blood is quite effective.

19:15.904 --> 19:16.822
Nezuko!

19:22.786 --> 19:25.038
That looks fun.

19:25.622 --> 19:28.167
Let me join you guys!

19:36.258 --> 19:37.885
This pressure,

19:39.094 --> 19:40.637
it's crushing my body.

20:12.753 --> 20:14.963
It's time for the finishing blow.

20:18.091 --> 20:19.843
We're under attack!

20:19.927 --> 20:21.762
It's the demons!

20:48.330 --> 20:49.164
Get up.

20:53.168 --> 20:56.296
We're under attack! Protect our village!

21:03.929 --> 21:05.764
Hurry.

21:05.847 --> 21:08.058
The village is in danger.

21:08.141 --> 21:10.936
Save the villagers as quickly as possible.

21:12.646 --> 21:15.899
I have to hurry, pronto.
Everyone in the village is in danger.

21:16.400 --> 21:17.526
But surprisingly,

21:17.609 --> 21:22.948
the village of the swordsmiths is so close
to the district I'm in charge of.

21:25.117 --> 21:27.786
Hurry. The village is
on the brink of collapse.

21:32.082 --> 21:34.459
All right. I'll do my best.

23:06.051 --> 23:07.052
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC
NO. 4

23:08.178 --> 23:09.304
Long time no see!

23:09.387 --> 23:12.224
Now it's time for a Kimetsu Academy story!

23:12.307 --> 23:14.726
My name is Mitsuri Kanroji, 19 years old.

23:14.810 --> 23:18.605
My dream is to make people
around the world happy with my paintings.

23:19.189 --> 23:20.857
Hey. Will you listen?

23:20.941 --> 23:25.862
When does the man
who will make me happy appear?

23:25.946 --> 23:29.074
No one is going to love you.

23:29.157 --> 23:30.200
Huh?

23:30.784 --> 23:34.788
Look, your hair is pink, you're a glutton
and as powerful as a gorilla.

23:36.957 --> 23:38.750
Isn't that why you paint?

23:39.334 --> 23:41.586
That's your way of life.

23:42.879 --> 23:45.465
You're right.
No other choice than to paint.

23:46.091 --> 23:49.845
Only my paintings
can make everyone happy.

23:50.929 --> 23:54.474
SHE'S POPULAR WITH MEN,
BUT SHE IS UNAWARE OF IT

23:55.058 --> 23:57.227
Next up on "Episode 5: Bright Red Blade."

23:57.310 --> 23:58.145
TO BE CONTINUED

23:58.228 --> 24:00.355
I also want a boyfriend, after all.
